 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Try listening to podcasts in the language you want to learn. You can set them to repeat certain sections, and you can practice repeating along. Out loud is better, because it connects your brain to your mouth more directly. Reading and writing are useful too, but talking is the key. Try watching short videos in the language, and try explaining them out loud. That's normal. Just practice doing it. You can start with short phrases you know, like your name and where you're from. Honestly, it really helps. Keep it short.",
